   "line_kind": "bullet",
   "section": "(opening)",
   "text": "2. **kidneys/reins (kilyah) → conscience, not viscera.** Scripture pairs the kidneys with the heart precisely as the seat God *searches and tests* — the moral/conscience self (Ps 7:9; 26:2; Jer 11:20; 17:10). It is the Hebrew analogue of *suneidesis*, so it belongs with **conscience**, not the generic viscera.",
