    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "line_no": 35,
   "line_kind": "bullet",
   "section": "(opening)",
   "text": "- **inward-part** (qereb): seat only when it denotes the *person's* inner being (\"hot within me\", Ps 39:3) — **not** the locative \"in the midst of [the camp/land/people]\".",
